Inuit leaders, Indigenous scholars disappointed after Senate votes down residential school denialism clause
Nunavut Sen. Nancy Karetak-Lindell says she based wording of amendment on law criminalizing Holocaust denial

Bianca McKeown · CBC News · Posted: Jun 11, 2026 12:48 PM ADT | Last Updated: June 11

